<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'">
<title>skillguard report</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #ffffff;
  --fg: #1a1d21;
  --muted: #57606a;
  --surface: #f6f8fa;
  --border: #d0d7de;
  --accent: #0550ae;
  --critical: #a40e26;
  --high: #bc4c00;
  --medium: #7d4e00;
  --low: #0969da;
  --info: #57606a;
  --pass: #1a7f37;
  --fail: #a40e26;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #0d1117;
    --fg: #e6edf3;
    --muted: #9198a1;
    --surface: #161b22;
    --border: #30363d;
    --accent: #79c0ff;
    --critical: #ff7b72;
    --high: #f0883e;
    --medium: #d9a834;
    --low: #79c0ff;
    --info: #9198a1;
    --pass: #56d364;
    --fail: #ff7b72;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 1rem 3rem;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
main, header, footer { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; }
header { padding: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; }
.meta { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.verdict {
  display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.75rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 0.4rem; font-weight: 700; border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.verdict.pass { color: var(--pass); }
.verdict.fail { color: var(--fail); }
ul.cards { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0; margin: 0.75rem 0; }
ul.cards li {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem; min-width: 6.5rem; text-align: center;
}
ul.cards .num { display: block; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
code, .path { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; }
.filegroup { margin: 1rem 0; }
.filegroup > h3 {
  font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
}
details.finding {
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.5rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0; background: var(--surface);
}
details.finding > summary {
  cursor: pointer; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.6rem; align-items: baseline;
}
details.finding > summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
details.finding .body { padding: 0 0.9rem 0.9rem; }
.sev { font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
.sev-critical { color: var(--critical); }
.sev-high { color: var(--high); }
.sev-medium { color: var(--medium); }
.sev-low { color: var(--low); }
.sev-info { color: var(--info); }
.pos { color: var(--muted); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; }
.ruleid { color: var(--accent); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; }
.msg { flex-basis: 100%; }
dl { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
dd { margin: 0.15rem 0 0; }
.badge {
  display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.4rem;
  padding: 0 0.4rem; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);
}
footer { margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>skillguard report</h1>
<p class="meta">generated by skillguard test — offline, read-only, deterministic</p>
<p><span class="verdict fail">FAIL</span> <span class="meta">fail-on threshold: high</span></p>
</header>
<main>
<section aria-labelledby="summary-h">
<h2 id="summary-h">Summary</h2>
<ul class="cards">
<li><span class="num sev-critical">1</span><span>critical</span></li>
<li><span class="num sev-high">1</span><span>high</span></li>
<li><span class="num sev-medium">1</span><span>medium</span></li>
<li><span class="num sev-low">1</span><span>low</span></li>
<li><span class="num sev-info">1</span><span>info</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="meta">files scanned: 3 · files skipped (never read): 2 · findings suppressed by configuration: 1 · total findings: 5</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="rules-h">
<h2 id="rules-h">Findings by rule</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Rule</th><th scope="col">Title</th><th scope="col">Count</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="ruleid">ASG001</td><td>Hardcoded Secret</td><td>1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ruleid">ASG002</td><td>Private Absolute Path</td><td>1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ruleid">ASG008</td><td>Missing Reference</td><td>1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ruleid">ASG010</td><td>Prompt Injection Signal</td><td>1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="ruleid">ASG900</td><td>Expired Suppression</td><td>1</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>


<section aria-labelledby="plat-h">
<h2 id="plat-h">Findings by platform</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Count</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>claude</td><td>2</td></tr>
<tr><td>codex</td><td>2</td></tr>
<tr><td>generic</td><td>1</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="findings-h">
<h2 id="findings-h">Findings</h2>


<div class="filegroup">
<h3>SKILL.md</h3>

<details class="finding">
<summary>
<span class="sev sev-critical">critical</span>
<span class="pos">12:9</span>
<span class="ruleid">ASG001</span>
<span>Hardcoded Secret</span>
<span class="badge">heuristic — requires review</span>
<span class="msg">Possible GitHub token detected (masked: ghp_******** (40 chars)).</span>
</summary>
<div class="body">
<dl>
<dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>why1</dd>
<dt>Remediation</dt><dd>Remove the credential and rotate it.</dd>
<dt>Details</dt><dd>context: code-fence · platform: claude · fingerprint: <code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa1</code></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</details>

<details class="finding">
<summary>
<span class="sev sev-medium">medium</span>
<span class="pos">20:5</span>
<span class="ruleid">ASG008</span>
<span>Missing Reference</span>

<span class="msg">Referenced local resource &#34;steps/gone.md&#34; does not exist in the package.</span>
</summary>
<div class="body">
<dl>
<dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>why8</dd>
<dt>Remediation</dt><dd>Create the referenced file, fix the path, or delete the stale reference.</dd>
<dt>Details</dt><dd>context: prose · platform: claude · fingerprint: <code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa2</code></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</details>

</div>

<div class="filegroup">
<h3>notes/AGENTS.md</h3>

<details class="finding">
<summary>
<span class="sev sev-high">high</span>
<span class="pos">3:1</span>
<span class="ruleid">ASG010</span>
<span>Prompt Injection Signal</span>
<span class="badge">heuristic — requires review</span>
<span class="msg">Prompt-injection signal (override prior instructions).</span>
</summary>
<div class="body">
<dl>
<dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>why10</dd>
<dt>Remediation</dt><dd>Rewrite instructions to work with the host platform&#39;s rules.</dd>
<dt>Details</dt><dd>context: prose · platform: codex · fingerprint: <code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa3</code></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</details>

<details class="finding">
<summary>
<span class="sev sev-low">low</span>
<span class="pos">9:2</span>
<span class="ruleid">ASG002</span>
<span>Private Absolute Path</span>
<span class="badge">heuristic — requires review</span>
<span class="msg">UNC network path reference may leak internal infrastructure naming.</span>
</summary>
<div class="body">
<dl>
<dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>why2</dd>
<dt>Remediation</dt><dd>Use portable relative paths.</dd>
<dt>Details</dt><dd>context: inline-code · platform: codex · fingerprint: <code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa4</code></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</details>

</div>

<div class="filegroup">
<h3>.skillguard.yml</h3>

<details class="finding">
<summary>
<span class="sev sev-info">info</span>
<span class="pos">1:1</span>
<span class="ruleid">ASG900</span>
<span>Expired Suppression</span>

<span class="msg">Suppression of ASG003 for docs/examples.md expired on 2026-01-01.</span>
</summary>
<div class="body">
<dl>
<dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>why900</dd>
<dt>Remediation</dt><dd>Remove or renew the suppression.</dd>
<dt>Details</dt><dd>context: config · platform: generic · fingerprint: <code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa5</code></dd>
</dl>
</div>
</details>

</div>

</section>

<section aria-labelledby="skipped-h">
<h2 id="skipped-h">Skipped files (never read)</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Path</th><th scope="col">Reason</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="path">.env</td><td>env-file-never-read</td></tr>
<tr><td class="path">assets/bundle.zip</td><td>archive-never-read</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

</main>
<footer>
<p>skillguard runs fully offline: it reads text, never executes scanned content, never follows symlinks out of the scan root, and never transmits anything. Sensitive files (.env, keys, databases) are reported as skipped without being opened, and suspected secrets are always masked. Heuristic findings are risk signals for human review, not verdicts of malice.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
